long with our newest City Cast Nashville staff member, Emma White, to shout out their favorite happenings around town. From square dancing at Bells Bend to Kacey Musgraves at Bridgestone and a witchy pop-up at East Nashville Beer Works, this month has something for everyone. And don't forget, our first-ever live podcast recording and show, \u003ca href=\"https://nashville.zanies.com/show/city-cast-nashvilles-roast-of-music-city/the-lab/\"\u003eCity Cast Nashville Presents: The Roast of Music City\u003c/a\u003e on Sept. 15 at The Lab at Zanies. Get your \u003ca href=\"https://www.etix.com/ticket/p/52097582/city-cast-nashvilles-roast-of-music-city-nashville-the-lab-at-zanies?partner_id=100\u0026amp;_gl=1*1l8hyx0*_ga*MzUyMTczNDg4LjE3ODM2MjI3MjQ.*_ga_76DGCEXM0E*czE3ODgxOTY5MDMkbzExJGcwJHQxNzg4MTk2OTAzJGo2MCRsMCRoNDY4MDQ3MzQ2*_gcl_au*MTYxOTUyNjc2OC4xNzgzNjIyNzI0*_ga_MZXSS2FQDS*czE3ODgxOTY5MDQkbzExJGcwJHQxNzg4MTk2OTA0JGo2MCRsMCRoMTg5MTc5NzE3NA..\"\u003etickets\u003c/a\u003e today!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLearn more about the sponsors of this Tuesday, September 1st episode:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.nashvilleballet.com/\"\u003eNashville Ballet\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.gulfshores.com/\"\u003eAlabama Beaches\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGet more from City Cast Nashville when you become a \u003ca href=\"http://membership.citycast.fm/nashville\"\u003eCity Cast Nashville Neighbor\u003c/a\u003e. You’ll enjoy perks like ad-free listening, invitations to members only events and more. Join now at\u003ca href=\"https://account.citycast.fm/become-a-neighbor/nashville?utm_source=show_notes\u0026amp;utm_medium=pod\u0026amp;utm_campaign=pod_promo\"\u003e membership.citycast.fm/nashville\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWant some more City Cast Nashville news? Then make sure to sign up for our \u003ca href=\"https://nashville.citycast.fm/subscribe-hey-nashville-newsletter-tennessee\"\u003eC