328","id":"CC5935687328","src":"https://dcs.megaphone.fm/CC5935687328.mp3","shareableUrl":"https://megaphone.link/CC5935687328","ogImageUrl":null,"image":{"_type":"image","asset":{"_ref":"image-a73f7ad19af9dac258a3b5fab539b90de5434fc6-3000x3000-png","_type":"reference"}},"author":"City Cast Nashville"},{"_createdAt":"2026-08-31T09:10:29Z","_id":"nashville.37a2a962-9762-11f1-861c-bfa16fb0cd78","_nlpGeneratedAt":1788167429428,"_rev":"5GEsfwVxlc4yXJFjqBKtYi","_type":"podcast","_updatedAt":"2026-08-31T09:10:29Z","audioFile":"https://storage.googleapis.com/off-platform-audio-distribution/793997d94370e5140ff5308650f164985cb84ed5?X-Goog-Algorithm=GOOG4-RSA-SHA256\u0026X-Goog-Credential=creator-media-transcoder%40gke-accounts.iam.gserviceaccount.com%2F20260831%2Fauto%2Fstorage%2Fgoog4_request\u0026X-Goog-Date=20260831T091026Z\u0026X-Goog-Expires=172800\u0026X-Goog-SignedHeaders=host\u0026X-Goog-","date":"2026-08-31","description":"\u003cp\u003eLegislation \u003ca href=\"https://nashville.legistar.com/LegislationDetail.aspx?ID=8154627\u0026amp;GUID=97FFB180-F406-4C1A-970A-814FF26B9884\"\u003eregulating how law enforcement can use drones\u003c/a\u003e in Nashville is on its final reading at Metro Council tomorrow night. But are drones just a small piece of something bigger? Journalist Nick Pipitone joins host Rachel Iacovone to discuss \u003ca href=\"https://www.nashvillescene.com/news/citylimits/mnpd-drone-trial-surveillance-push/article_54efb72e-f35a-4f5d-ab2b-8ac5a1cac56f.html\"\u003ehis recent Nashville Scene article\u003c/a\u003e about how systems like Flock, Fusus, and Skydio are designed to work together in “real-time crime centers” and enhance what the Community Review Board recently called “MNPD’s steadily expanding surveillance apparatus.”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLearn more about the sponsors of this August 31st episode:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.gulfshores.com/\"\u003eAlabama’s Beaches\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.nashvilleballet.com/\"\u003eNashville Ballet\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGet more from City Cast Nashville when you become a \u003ca href=\"http://membership.citycast.fm/nashville\"\u003eCity Cast Nashville Neighbor\u003c/a\u003e. You’ll enjoy perks like ad-free listening, invitations to members only events and more. Join now at\u003ca href=\"https://account.citycast.fm/become-a-neighbor/nashville?utm_source=show_notes\u0026amp;utm_medium=pod\u0026amp;utm_campaign=pod_promo\"\u003e membership.citycast.fm/nashville\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWant some more City Cast Nashville news? Then make sure to sign up for our \u003ca href=\"https://nashville.citycast.fm/subscribe-hey-nashville-newsletter-tennessee\"\u003eCity Cast Nashville newsletter.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFollow us \u003ca href=\"https://www.instagram.com/citycastnashville/\"\u003e@citycastnashville\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou can also text us or leave a voicemail at: 615-200-6392\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInterested in advertising with City Cast? Find more info \u003ca href=\"https://citycast.fm/advertise/\"\u003eHERE\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e","duration":"1163.92","keyphrases":["drones in nashville","recent nashville scene article","surveillance apparatus","nashville ballet","more from city cast nashville","city cast nashville neighbor","more city cast nashville news","city cast nashville newsletter","interested in advertising with city cast"],"keysentences":["Journalist Nick Pipitone joins host Rachel Iacovone to discuss his recent Nashville Scene article about how systems like Flock, Fusus, and Skydio are designed to work together in “real-time crime centers” and enhance what the Community Review Board recently called “MNPD’s steadily expanding surveillance apparatus.”","Learn more about the sponsors of this August 31st episode:","Then make sure to sign up for our City Cast Nashville newsletter."],"keywords":["drones","surveillance","nashville","cast","city"],"path":"/podcasts/nashvilles-growing-mass-surveillance-network","slug":"nashvilles-growing-mass-surveillance-network","tags":null,"title":"Nashville’s Growing Mass Surveillance Network","topic":null,"uid":"CC8887701975","id":"CC8887701975","src":"https://dcs.megaphone.fm/CC8887701975.mp3","shareableUrl":"https://megaphone.link/CC8887701975","ogImageUrl":null,"image":{"_type":"image","asset":{"_ref":"image-a73f7ad19af9dac258a3b5fab539b90de5434fc6-3000x3000-png","_type":"reference"}},"author":"City Cast Nashville"},{"_createdAt":"2026-08-30T09:10:24Z","_id":"nashville.d3a37c4a-8c47-11f1-8b9b-d7ab40bc2f9f","_nlpGeneratedAt":1788081024842,"_rev":"g51G21OrCyes29kMCJI7Fn","_type":"podcast","_updatedAt":"2026-08-30T09:10:24Z","audioFile":"https://storage.googleapis.com/off-platform-audio-distribution/a9f618e446ac7b3c828f0da3960130e9fc5713f2?X-Goog-Algorithm=GOOG4-RSA-SHA256\u0026X-Goog-Credential=creator-media-transcoder%40gke-accounts.iam.gserviceaccount.com%2F20260830%2Fauto%2Fstorage%2Fgoog4_request\u0026X-Goog-Date=20260830T091022Z\u0026X-Goog-Expires=172800\u0026X-Goog-SignedHeaders=host\u0026X-Goog-","date":"2026-08-30","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Nashville airport definitely has a lot going for it, but what it doesn’t have is its own electrical grid, like Pittsburgh’s does. For the past few years, Pittsburgh International Airport has been generating on-site electricity, more than it needs even at peak operation, to fortify itself against the kind of power outages that hit airports (unsettlingly often) across the world. City Cast Pittsburgh host Megan Harris brings David into the little-known world of airport energy independence, showing how a one-time investment can bring the kind of peace of mind that both travelers and operators hope for every day.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIs there something your city is doing that we should be talking about? \u003ca href=\"mailto:yourcitycouldbebetter@citycast.fm\"\u003eEmail David now!\u0026nbsp;\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe’re also on Instagram: \u003ca href=\"https://www.instagram.com/yourcitycouldbebetter\"\u003e@yourcitycouldbebetter\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLooking to advertise on Your City Could Be Better? \u003ca href=\"https://citycast.fm/advertise\"\u003eCheck out our options\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e","duration":"1532.16","keyphrases":["nashville airport","pittsburgh international airport","kind of power outages","city cast pittsburgh host megan harris","world of airport energy independence","kind of peace of mind"],"keysentences":["The Nashville airport definitely has a lot going for it, but what it doesn’t have is its own electrical grid, like Pittsburgh’s does.","For the past few years, Pittsburgh International Airport has been generating on-site electricity, more than it needs even at peak operation, to fortify itself against the kind of power outages that hit airports (unsettlingly often) across the world.","City Cast Pittsburgh host Megan Harris brings David into the little-known world of airport energy independence, showing how a one-time investment can bring the kind of peace of mind that both travelers and operators hope for every day."],"keywords":["pittsburgh","airport","kind","world","better","david"],"path":"/podcasts/your-city-could-be-better-why-is-pittsburghs-airport-the-gold-standard-presented-by-city-cast-nashville","slug":"your-city-could-be-better-why-is-pittsburghs-airport-the-gold-standard-presented-by-city-cast-nashville","tags":null,"title":"‘Your City Could Be Better’: Why Is Pittsburgh’s Airport the Gold Standard? — Presented By City Cast Nashville","topic":null,"uid":"CC4762171791","id":"CC4762171791","src":"https://dcs.megaphone.fm/CC4762171791.mp3","shareableUrl":"https://megaphone.link/CC4762171791","ogImageUrl":null,"image":{"_type":"image","asset":{"_ref":"image-a73f7ad19af9dac258a3b5fab539b90de5434fc6-3000x3000-png","_type":"reference"}},"author":"City Cast Nashville"},{"_createdAt":"2026-08-28T09:11:14Z","_id":"nashville.0dc00efa-9762-11f1-9a7d-ffc1e469a732","_nlpGeneratedAt":1787908273944,"_rev":"2bPHLtb5fX5qh3HXNNLMH1","_type":"podcast","_updatedAt":"2026-08-28T09:11:14Z","audioFile":"https://storage.googleapis.com/off-platform-audio-distribution/784a859c30466a24150fa45e34d1b541cc225b68?X-Goog-Algorithm=GOOG4-RSA-SHA256\u0026X-Goog-Credential=creator-media-transcoder%40gke-accounts.iam.gserviceaccount.com%2F20260828%2Fauto%2Fstorage%2Fgoog4_request\u0026X-Goog-Date=20260828T091110Z\u0026X-Goog-Expires=172800\u0026X-Goog-SignedHeaders=host\u0026X-Goog-","date":"2026-08-28","description":"\u003cp\u003eFollowing Dolly Parton’s passing, \u003ca href=\"https://www.change.org/p/rename-nashville-international-airport-to-dolly-parton-international-airport-d234875f-d5aa-4c57-8027-99bfd2594721?recruiter=88133320\u0026amp;recruited_by_id=1585ec70-b9be-11e3-a161-97cd7b4cd8f1\u0026amp;utm_source=share_petition\u0026amp;utm_campaign=psf_promote_or_share\u0026amp;utm_term=owned\u0026amp;utm_medium=mobileNativeShare\u0026amp;share_id=Wjq6fzMmTB\"\u003ea petition\u003c/a\u003e to rename BNA in her honor has surpassed 130,000 signatures — but could it really happen? Host Rachel Iacovone is joined by creative producer Marie Cecile Anderson and executive producer Whitney Pastorek to discuss \u003ca href=\"https://www.wkrn.com/news/local-news/nashville/tennessee-lawmaker-vows-to-file-bill-to-rename-airport-after-dolly-parton-amid-growing-petition/\"\u003ethe proposed name change\u003c/a\u003e, a new \u003ca href=\"https://www.nashvillescene.com/news/pithinthewind/former-executive-sues-metro-nashville-airport-authority/article_7937bfaa-02b2-587e-8cfb-8fd76d2d6d90.html\"\u003eAirport Authority lawsuit\u003c/a\u003e, the fight for \u003ca href=\"https://www.wkrn.com/news/local-news/nashville/nashville-approves-2-pedal-taverns-for-people-with-mobility-issues-disabilities/\"\u003eaccessible pedal taverns\u003c/a\u003e, and how Nashville is paying tribute to Dolly. Plus, don’t miss our members-only segment, Hell Naw, where this week’s rant takes on the many mischaracterizations of the Queen of Country.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLearn more about the sponsors of this August 28th episode:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://musicianscorner.com/\"\u003eCentennial Park Conservancy\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.hoffmannbros.com/nashville\"\u003eHoffmann Brothers\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGet more from City Cast Nashville when you become a \u003ca href=\"http://membership.citycast.fm/nashville\"\u003eCity Cast Nashville Neighbor\u003c/a\u003e. You’ll enjoy perks like ad-free listening, invitations to members only events and more. Join now at\u003ca href=\"https://account.citycast.fm/become-a-neighbor/nashville?utm_source=show_notes\u0026amp;utm_medium=pod\u0026amp;utm_campaign=pod_promo\"\u003e membership.citycast.fm/nashville\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWant some more City Cast Nashville news? Then make sure to sign up for our \u003ca href=\"https://nashville.citycast.fm/subscribe-hey-nashville-newsletter-tennessee\"\u003eCity Cast Nashville newsletter.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFollow us \u003ca href=\"https://www.instagram.com/citycastnashville/\"\u003e@citycastnashville\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou can also text us or leave a voicemail at: 615-200-6392\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInterested in advertising with City Cast? Find more info \u003ca href=\"https://citycast.fm/advertise/\"\u003eHERE\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e","duration":"1448.51","keyphrases":["dolly parton","tribute to dolly","more from city cast nashville","city cast nashville neighbor","more city cast nashville news","city cast nashville newsletter","interested in advertising with city cast"],"keysentences":["Host Rachel Iacovone is joined by creative producer Marie Cecile Anderson and executive producer Whitney Pastorek to discuss the proposed name change, a new Airport Authority lawsuit, the fight for accessible pedal taverns, and how Nashville is paying tribute to Dolly.","Learn more about the sponsors of this August 28th episode:","Then make sure to sign up for our City Cast Nashville newsletter."],"keywords":["dolly","bna","nashville","cast","city"],"path":"/podcasts/will-bna-be-renamed-after-dolly-plus-live-on-the-green-returns","slug":"will-bna-be-renamed-after-dolly-plus-live-on-the-green-returns","tags":null,"title":"Will BNA Be Renamed After Dolly? Plus, Live on the Green Returns","topic":null,"uid":"CC1645820721","id":"CC1645820721","src":"https://dcs.megaphone.fm/CC1645820721.mp3","shareableUrl":"https://megaphone.link/CC1645820721","ogImageUrl":null,"image":{"_type":"image","asset":{"_ref":"image-a73f7ad19af9dac258a3b5fab539b90de5434fc6-3000x3000-png","_type":"reference"}},"author":"City Cast Nashville"},{"_createdAt":"2026-08-27T09:11:11Z","_id":"nashville.08627ad8-9762-11f1-a755-c32eeb1aca8c","_nlpGeneratedAt":1787821871362,"_rev":"QptjY1CXcknoQ2xcRuLhe4","_type":"podcast","_updatedAt":"2026-08-27T09:11:11Z","audioFile":"https://storage.googleapis.com/off-platform-audio-distribution/a9b3e1e2ec8a8aaffaf817bc98eab0adbc67420b?X-Goog-Algorithm=GOOG4-RSA-SHA256\u0026X-Goog-Credential=creator-media-transcoder%40gke-accounts.iam.gserviceaccount.com%2F20260827%2Fauto%2Fstorage%2Fgoog4_request\u0026X-Goog-Date=20260827T091108Z\u0026X-Goog-Expires=172800\u0026X-Goog-SignedHeaders=host\u0026X-Goog-","date":"2026-08-27","description":"\u003cp\u003eWe’re learning more about the companies behind \u003ca href=\"https://tennesseelookout.com/2026/08/20/tennessee-tabs-road-building-group-for-9b-toll-lanes-project/\"\u003eDriveTN\u003c/a\u003e, the consortium tapped to build controversial toll roads between here and Murfreesboro, and at least one state legislator wants to know \u003ca href=\"https://www.wkrn.com/news/local-news/foreign-private-companies-to-run-middle-tennessee-choice-lanes/\"\u003ewhy we can’t keep the profits here at home\u003c/a\u003e. Host Rachel Iacovone and executive producer Whitney Pastorek are digging into that on today’s Tuesday News Roundup. Plus, Cheekwood won the first battle in their \u003ca href=\"https://nashvillebanner.com/2026/08/21/cheekwood-parking-garage-legal-battle-update/\"\u003ebig parking garage fight\u003c/a\u003e, and \u003ca href=\"https://www.tennessean.com/story/news/2026/08/21/bed-bath-beyond-rebrand-nashville-neighborhood-intelligence/91404831007/\"\u003enew corporations\u003c/a\u003e are eyeing a move to Nashville — just as \u003ca href=\"https://komonews.com/news/local/starbucks-files-another-layoff-notice-for-seattle-hq-200-jobs-affected-coffee-company-employment-economy-nashville-corporate-organization-restructuring-store-tourism-travel-employee\"\u003e120 Starbucks employees\u003c/a\u003e said no to that move. And in good news: Could a beloved music festival be \u003ca href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DcbHWSDR_x9/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\u0026amp;igsi=MzRlODBiNWFlZA==\"\u003ecoming back\u003c/a\u003e?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLearn more about the sponsors of this August 27th episode:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://musicianscorner.com/\"\u003eCentennial Park Conservancy\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.hoffmannbros.com/nashville\"\u003eHoffmann Brothers\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://vote.nashvillescene.com/media-and-politics\"\u003eVOTE FOR US\u003c/a\u003e in the Nashville Scene’s Best of Nashville 2026 Awards!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGet more from City Cast Nashville when you become a \u003ca href=\"http://membership.citycast.fm/nashville\"\u003eCity Cast Nashville Neighbor\u003c/a\u003e. You’ll enjoy perks like ad-free listening, invitations to members only events and more. Join now at\u003ca href=\"https://account.citycast.fm/become-a-neighbor/nashville?utm_source=show_notes\u0026amp;utm_medium=pod\u0026amp;utm_campaign=pod_promo\"\u003e membership.citycast.fm/nashville\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWant some more City Cast Nashville news? Then make sure to sign up for our \u003ca href=\"https://nashville.citycast.fm/subscribe-hey-nashville-newsletter-tennessee\"\u003eCity Cast Nashville newsletter.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFollow us \u003ca href=\"https://www.instagram.com/citycastnashville/\"\u003e@citycastnashville\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou can also text us or leave a voicemail at: 615-200-6392\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInterested in advertising with City Cast? Find more info \u003ca href=\"https://citycast.fm/advertise/\"\u003eHERE\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e","duration":"1226.75","keyphrases":["learning companies behind drivetn","controversial toll roads","state legislator","host rachel iacovone","first battle","big parking garage fight","new corporations","move to nashville","starbucks employees","beloved music festival","centennial park conservancy","hoffmann brothers","nashville scene best of nashville","more from city cast nashville","city cast nashville neighbor","more city cast nashville news","city cast nashville newsletter","interested in advertising with city cast"],"keysentences":["Learn more about the sponsors of this August 27th episode:","Get more from City Cast Nashville when you become a City Cast Nashville Neighbor.","Then make sure to sign up for our City Cast Nashville newsletter."],"keywords":["nashville","cast","city","grid","n.c.","highlands","drivetn","consortium","legislator","profits","corporations","toll","murfreesboro","garage","eyeing","starbucks","employees","companies","learning","roads","fight","fall","trips","battle","parking","digging","iacovone","road","rachel","conservancy","hoffmann","cheekwood","centennial","brothers","home","coming","festival"],"path":"/podcasts/fall-road-trips-get-off-the-grid-in-highlands-nc","slug":"fall-road-trips-get-off-the-grid-in-highlands-nc","tags":null,"title":"Fall Road Trips: Get Off the Grid in Highlands, N.C.","topic":null,"uid":"CC7464788880","id":"CC7464788880","src":"https://dcs.megaphone.fm/CC7464788880.mp3","shareableUrl":"https://megaphone.link/CC7464788880","ogImageUrl":null,"image":{"_type":"image","asset":{"_ref":"image-a73f7ad19af9dac258a3b5fab539b90de5434fc6-3000x3000-png","_type":"reference"}},"author":"City Cast Nashville"},{"_createdAt":"2026-08-26T09:11:12Z","_id":"nashville.08412694-9762-11f1-a755-cb3cb9ef1b1f","_nlpGeneratedAt":1787735471987,"_rev":"3iJErC6GWS1f9DzbpfBefk","_type":"podcast","_updatedAt":"2026-08-26T09:11:12Z","audioFile":"https://storage.googleapis.com/off-platform-audio-distribution/522e43b3023e7ecbe81f13933a0b7f7af90ca134?X-Goog-Algorithm=GOOG4-RSA-SHA256\u0026X-Goog-Credential=creator-media-transcoder%40gke-accounts.iam.gserviceaccount.com%2F20260826%2Fauto%2Fstorage%2Fgoog4_request\u0026X-Goog-Date=20260826T091108Z\u0026X-Goog-Expires=172800\u0026X-Goog-SignedHeaders=host\u0026X-Goog-","date":"2026-08-26","description":"\u003cp\u003eYesterday, we all learned that Dolly Parton had passed away at age 80, right here in Nashville. Host Rachel Iacovone is joined by creative producer Marie Cecile Anderson and executive producer Whitney Pastorek to pay tribute to the queen herself and, above all else, remember her light, her magic, and her kindness toward ALL human beings.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLearn more about the sponsors of this August 26th episode:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://musicianscorner.com/\"\u003eCentennial Park Conservancy\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.hoffmannbros.com/nashville\"\u003eHoffmann Brothers\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://vote.nashvillescene.com/media-and-politics\"\u003eVOTE FOR US\u003c/a\u003e in the Nashville Scene’s Best of Nashville 2026 Awards!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGet more from City Ca