":"https://megaphone.link/CC8414966756","ogImageUrl":null,"image":{"_type":"image","asset":{"_ref":"image-a73f7ad19af9dac258a3b5fab539b90de5434fc6-3000x3000-png","_type":"reference"}},"author":"City Cast Nashville"},{"_createdAt":"2026-08-25T09:11:15Z","_id":"nashville.0d9c691e-9762-11f1-9a7d-c7b1ef832711","_nlpGeneratedAt":1787649075312,"_rev":"oUidy6mk7tgna4QYbl4dF8","_type":"podcast","_updatedAt":"2026-08-25T09:11:15Z","audioFile":"https://storage.googleapis.com/off-platform-audio-distribution/a7b6c5d78e11bc6966b4ab858cfef52fc92856d4?X-Goog-Algorithm=GOOG4-RSA-SHA256\u0026X-Goog-Credential=creator-media-transcoder%40gke-accounts.iam.gserviceaccount.com%2F20260825%2Fauto%2Fstorage%2Fgoog4_request\u0026X-Goog-Date=20260825T091112Z\u0026X-Goog-Expires=172800\u0026X-Goog-SignedHeaders=host\u0026X-Goog-","date":"2026-08-25","description":"\u003cp\u003eWe’re learning more about the companies behind \u003ca href=\"https://tennesseelookout.com/2026/08/20/tennessee-tabs-road-building-group-for-9b-toll-lanes-project/\"\u003eDriveTN\u003c/a\u003e, the consortium tapped to build controversial toll roads between here and Murfreesboro, and at least one state legislator wants to know \u003ca href=\"https://www.wkrn.com/news/local-news/foreign-private-companies-to-run-middle-tennessee-choice-lanes/\"\u003ewhy we can’t keep the profits here at home\u003c/a\u003e. Host Rachel Iacovone and executive producer Whitney Pastorek are digging into that on today’s Tuesday News Roundup. Plus, Cheekwood won the first battle in their \u003ca href=\"https://nashvillebanner.com/2026/08/21/cheekwood-parking-garage-legal-battle-update/\"\u003ebig parking garage fight\u003c/a\u003e, and \u003ca href=\"https://www.tennessean.com/story/news/2026/08/21/bed-bath-beyond-rebrand-nashville-neighborhood-intelligence/91404831007/\"\u003enew corporations\u003c/a\u003e are eyeing a move to Nashville — just as \u003ca href=\"https://komonews.com/news/local/starbucks-files-another-layoff-notice-for-seattle-hq-200-jobs-affected-coffee-company-employment-economy-nashville-corporate-organization-restructuring-store-tourism-travel-employee\"\u003e120 Starbucks employees\u003c/a\u003e said no to that move. And in good news: Could a beloved music festival be \u003ca href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DcbHWSDR_x9/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\u0026amp;igsi=MzRlODBiNWFlZA==\"\u003ecoming back\u003c/a\u003e?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLearn more about the sponsors of this August 25th episode:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://musicianscorner.com/\"\u003eCentennial Park Conservancy\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.hoffmannbros.com/nashville\"\u003eHoffmann Brothers\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://vote.nashvillescene.com/media-and-politics\"\u003eVOTE FOR US\u003c/a\u003e in the Nashville Scene’s Best of Nashville 2026 Awards!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGet more from City Cast Nashville when you become a \u003ca href=\"http://membership.citycast.fm/nashville\"\u003eCity Cast Nashville Neighbor\u003c/a\u003e. You’ll enjoy perks like ad-free listening, invitations to members only events and more. Join now at\u003ca href=\"https://account.citycast.fm/become-a-neighbor/nashville?utm_source=show_notes\u0026amp;utm_medium=pod\u0026amp;utm_campaign=pod_promo\"\u003e membership.citycast.fm/nashville\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWant some more City Cast Nashville news? Then make sure to sign up for our \u003ca href=\"https://nashville.citycast.fm/subscribe-hey-nashville-newsletter-tennessee\"\u003eCity Cast Nashville newsletter.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFollow us \u003ca href=\"https://www.instagram.com/citycastnashville/\"\u003e@citycastnashville\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou can also text us or leave a voicemail at: 615-200-6392\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInterested in advertising with City Cast? Find more info \u003ca href=\"https://citycast.fm/advertise/\"\u003eHERE\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e","duration":"1553.21","keyphrases":["big parking garage fight","move to nashville","starbucks employees","nashville scene best of nashville","more from city cast nashville","city cast nashville neighbor","more city cast nashville news","city cast nashville newsletter","interested in advertising with city cast"],"keysentences":["Learn more about the sponsors of this August 25th episode:","Get more from City Cast Nashville when you become a City Cast Nashville Neighbor.","Then make sure to sign up for our City Cast Nashville newsletter."],"keywords":["starbucks","parking","nashville","cast","city"],"path":"/podcasts/starbucks-staffers-reject-nashville-plus-parking-problems-everywhere","slug":"starbucks-staffers-reject-nashville-plus-parking-problems-everywhere","tags":null,"title":"Starbucks Staffers Reject Nashville. Plus, Parking Problems Everywhere","topic":null,"uid":"CC3342528174","id":"CC3342528174","src":"https://dcs.megaphone.fm/CC3342528174.mp3","shareableUrl":"https://megaphone.link/CC3342528174","ogImageUrl":null,"image":{"_type":"image","asset":{"_ref":"image-a73f7ad19af9dac258a3b5fab539b90de5434fc6-3000x3000-png","_type":"reference"}},"author":"City Cast Nashville"},{"_createdAt":"2026-08-24T09:11:13Z","_id":"nashville.081647d0-9762-11f1-a755-f34ca9c3a014","_nlpGeneratedAt":1787562673257,"_rev":"XmanVytm1rRyN5PVljsfrZ","_type":"podcast","_updatedAt":"2026-08-24T09:11:13Z","audioFile":"https://storage.googleapis.com/off-platform-audio-distribution/65ab049078ca70a9e3857b86cfa7bedc4c090759?X-Goog-Algorithm=GOOG4-RSA-SHA256\u0026X-Goog-Credential=creator-media-transcoder%40gke-accounts.iam.gserviceaccount.com%2F20260824%2Fauto%2Fstorage%2Fgoog4_request\u0026X-Goog-Date=20260824T091109Z\u0026X-Goog-Expires=172800\u0026X-Goog-SignedHeaders=host\u0026X-Goog-","date":"2026-08-24","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe future of Nashville’s Fairgrounds Speedway might be up to voters this November, as petitioners work to collect signatures for a ballot amendment that would drop auto racing as a required use at the Fairgrounds and replace it with “affordable and/or workforce housing.” One group opposing the petition and fighting to preserve the racetrack is \u003ca href=\"https://liunalocal386.org/\"\u003eLiUNA Local 386\u003c/a\u003e. But why is the laborers’ union so invested? LiUNA business manager Ethan Link sits down with host Rachel Iacovone to explain why the speedway means more than just racing to his members.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLearn more about the sponsors of this August 24th episode:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://musicianscorner.com/\"\u003eCentennial Park Conservancy\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.hoffmannbros.com/nashville\"\u003eHoffmann Brothers\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://vote.nashvillescene.com/media-and-politics\"\u003eVOTE FOR US\u003c/a\u003e in the Nashville Scene’s Best of Nashville 2026 Awards!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGet more from City Cast Nashville when you become a \u003ca href=\"http://membership.citycast.fm/nashville\"\u003eCity Cast Nashville Neighbor\u003c/a\u003e. You’ll enjoy perks like ad-free listening, invitations to members only events and more. Join now at\u003ca href=\"https://account.citycast.fm/become-a-neighbor/nashville?utm_source=show_notes\u0026amp;utm_medium=pod\u0026amp;utm_campaign=pod_promo\"\u003e membership.citycast.fm/nashville\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWant some more City Cast Nashville news? Then make sure to sign up for our \u003ca href=\"https://nashville.citycast.fm/subscribe-hey-nashville-newsletter-tennessee\"\u003eCity Cast Nashville newsletter.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFollow us \u003ca href=\"https://www.instagram.com/citycastnashville/\"\u003e@citycastnashville\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou can also text us or leave a voicemail at: 615-200-6392\u003c/